Lords of Chaos is a drama, music, thriller film directed by Jonas Åkerlund.

3
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:46,000
A teenager's quest to launch Norwegian Black Metal in Oslo in
the 1990s results in a very violent outcome.

4
