10
01:05:33,333 --> 01:05:39,333
Lords of Chaos is a 2018 biographical horror film
directed and co-written by Jonas Åkerlund.

11
01:12:06,666 --> 01:12:12,666
Adapted from the 1998 book of the same name, the film is a fictionalized account of the early 1990s Norwegian black metal scene
told from the perspective of musician Øysten “Euronymous” Aarsten who co-founded the influential group Mayhem.

12
01:18:40,000 --> 01:18:46,000
The film stars Rory Culkin as Euronymous, Emory Cohen as Varg Vikernes, Jack
Kilmer as Per “Dead” Ohlin, and Sky Ferreira as Ann-Marit.

13
01:25:13,333 --> 01:25:19,333
The film premiered at the Sundance Film Festival on 23 January 2018.

14
01:31:46,666 --> 01:31:52,666
It was released in the United States on 8 February 2019 by Gunpowder & Sky, in the United Kingdom
on 29 March 2019 by Arrow Films and in Sweden on 5 April 2019 by Nordisk Film.

15
01:38:20,000 --> 01:38:26,000
Critical reception for Lords of Chaos was mostly positive, but fans of metal music were
sharply polarized and the musicians depicted in the film had mixed feelings.

16
01:44:53,333 --> 01:44:59,333
The film explores themes of suicide, based on novel or
book, nihilism, heavy metal, biography.

17
01:51:26,666 --> 01:51:32,666
The tone is intense and dark and emotional.
